{
  "file_id": "3590",
  "text_count": 119,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "t get it, but whatever...",
      "_offset": 0,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Yaaaaay! Joe, thank you!",
      "_offset": 26,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "We finally made it.",
      "_offset": 51,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "I wonder if any more Digimon are\ngonna attack us...",
      "_offset": 71,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "It's okay, we won't stick around\nfor long! Let's find as many\nDigiClams as we can!",
      "_offset": 123,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Matt, I challenge you!",
      "_offset": 206,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Sounds fun. Bring it on!",
      "_offset": 231,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Is it really okay to be taking all\nthese DigiClams?",
      "_offset": 256,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Sure! Why don't we take about five\nmillion?",
      "_offset": 308,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "F-f-five million?",
      "_offset": 352,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Hahaha, I'm kidding. You can't\ntake a joke at all!",
      "_offset": 370,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "We're all working together, so I\nthink you'll only need to get\naround five or so!",
      "_offset": 421,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Whew! Are these all the DigiClams?",
      "_offset": 503,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "That's it! Thanks so much, Joe!",
      "_offset": 538,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "We really found a lot, didn't we?",
      "_offset": 570,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Yep! I bet the Marching Fishes\nwill be happy, too!",
      "_offset": 604,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "What's going on? Are Tai and\nMatt fighting? Let's check it\nout.",
      "_offset": 655,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "My DigiClams are bigger!",
      "_offset": 724,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "It's not the size that matters,\nit's the number you caught!",
      "_offset": 749,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Size!",
      "_offset": 809,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Number!",
      "_offset": 815,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Stop! Let's not get ahead of\nourselves!",
      "_offset": 823,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Okay, let's have Joe decide!",
      "_offset": 863,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "There's no other way to settle\nthis!",
      "_offset": 892,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Whoever found the biggest\nDigiClams is the winner, right?",
      "_offset": 929,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Joe! Shouldn't the winner be the\none who gathered more?",
      "_offset": 987,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Um...",
      "_offset": 1043,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Tai's the winner!",
      "_offset": 1049,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Matt's the winner!",
      "_offset": 1070,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "It's a tie!",
      "_offset": 1091,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "All right!",
      "_offset": 1103,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "No way...",
      "_offset": 1114,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "See?",
      "_offset": 1124,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Whaaaaat?!",
      "_offset": 1129,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "That can't be right.",
      "_offset": 1140,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Hmmmm...",
      "_offset": 1161,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "(Both of them look\ndisappointed...)",
      "_offset": 1170,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Wait! Something's coming!",
      "_offset": 1206,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Ah!",
      "_offset": 1232,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "There *were* Digimon here after\nall!",
      "_offset": 1236,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "They came because they smelled the\nDigiClams!",
      "_offset": 1273,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Let's fight for 'em!",
      "_offset": 1319,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Whew. We managed to fight them\noff... Hey, Gomamon, look at all\nthe DigiClams we gathered!",
      "_offset": 1340,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Thank you, Joe! Guys! I bet the\nMarching Fishes will be really\nhappy!",
      "_offset": 1431,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "...Joe and Gomamon's happy faces\nmake me feel kinda stupid for\ngetting into that fight.",
      "_offset": 1501,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "It was my fault! I'm sorry.",
      "_offset": 1589,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "My bad too. I'm sorry.",
      "_offset": 1617,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Joe, you said that they tied\nbecause you didn't want them to\nfight, didn't you?",
      "_offset": 1640,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Hm? Well, yeah, that's basically\nit.",
      "_offset": 1720,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "You're amazing, Joe!",
      "_offset": 1757,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "You can only get DigiClams at\nsandy beaches!",
      "_offset": 1778,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Joe!",
      "_offset": 1823,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "What's up, T.K?",
      "_offset": 1828,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "I found this while we were looking\nfor DigiClams. I'll let you have\nit, Joe.",
      "_offset": 1847,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "I found this. I'll let you have\nit, Joe.",
      "_offset": 1924,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Ah, thank you so much!",
      "_offset": 1965,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "No problem, it's my thanks to you\nfor stopping that fight!",
      "_offset": 1988,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Obtained a DigiClam!",
      "_offset": 2047,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Hey, Joe, how's Matt doing?",
      "_offset": 2068,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "I mean, I'm just curious!",
      "_offset": 2098,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "We're in a contest, after all.\nAsking for help is basically\ncheating.",
      "_offset": 2124,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "I'll win, I'll definitely win...\n*mumble*",
      "_offset": 2194,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Nice job, Matt! What amazing\nconcentration!",
      "_offset": 2236,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "I mean, I know it's a thank-you\ngift, but I've never heard of\nDigiClams...",
      "_offset": 2282,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "We really aren't in Japan after\nall, huh.",
      "_offset": 2357,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "The sea breeze is bad for\nprecision machinery...",
      "_offset": 2399,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Why didn't you leave your computer\nbehind?",
      "_offset": 2448,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "I'm worried it'll break if I'm not\nwatching it...",
      "_offset": 2491,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "The sea breeze feels so good...",
      "_offset": 2541,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Looks like someone's having fun,\nunlike a certain someone who likes\nto get all high and mighty.",
      "_offset": 2573,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Hey! I'm doing my best, you know!",
      "_offset": 2669,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "T.Kuu! Look, look, it's a\nDigiStarfish!",
      "_offset": 2703,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Whoaaaaa! Wow!",
      "_offset": 2746,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Whoaaaaa! Wow!",
      "_offset": 2761,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Whoaaaaa! Wow!",
      "_offset": 2776,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Those two are totally fixated by\nthe seashore. Are they even\nlooking for DigiClams?",
      "_offset": 2791,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Seriously!",
      "_offset": 2875,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Hey, Joe. Why is ocean water\nsalty?",
      "_offset": 2886,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Because of the salt flow from land.",
      "_offset": 2922,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Because the ocean contains salt.",
      "_offset": 2958,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "It's because salt flows into the\nsea from the land!",
      "_offset": 2991,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Then how come river water isn't\nall that salty?",
      "_offset": 3043,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Now that you mention it, you might\nbe right...",
      "_offset": 3091,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Come on, Joe...",
      "_offset": 3138,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "It's because the ocean contains\ndissolved salt.",
      "_offset": 3154,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "But what about rain and river\nwater flowing in? Wouldn't that\ndilute it?",
      "_offset": 3202,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "True, but moisture evaporates from \nthe ocean's surface. If you're\ncurious, I'll lend you my book.",
      "_offset": 3275,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Thanks! I'll check it out!",
      "_offset": 3374,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "I've never heard of DigiClams\nbefore...",
      "_offset": 3401,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Me too. I wonder if they're like\nnormal clams?",
      "_offset": 3441,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "What do clams look like?",
      "_offset": 3488,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Try to answer it yourself",
      "_offset": 3513,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Ask an expert",
      "_offset": 3539,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "They're shellfish with two sides,\nand they have a zigzag pattern.",
      "_offset": 3553,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Aren't those scallops?",
      "_offset": 3619,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Huh? I was so sure those were\nclams...",
      "_offset": 3642,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "You're pretty unreliable...",
      "_offset": 3681,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Let's ask Gomamon.",
      "_offset": 3709,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "So there are things even you don't\nknow...",
      "_offset": 3728,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "It's better to get a definitive\nanswer from an expert than to rely\non incomplete knowledge.",
      "_offset": 3771,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "So that's how you think!",
      "_offset": 3863,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Hey, Mimi, why aren't you looking\nfor DigiClams too?",
      "_offset": 3888,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "I refuse! If I do that, I'll get\ndirty!",
      "_offset": 3941,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Then you can't have dinner today!",
      "_offset": 3981,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "I'll reward you if you help out.",
      "_offset": 4015,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "If you don't help out, I won't let\nyou have anything to eat!",
      "_offset": 4048,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Huh? I'm the one in charge of\ndinner today.",
      "_offset": 4109,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "So *you* won't get any dinner,\nJoe!",
      "_offset": 4153,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "N-no way. I'm sorry... please\nforget about this whole \"going\nwithout dinner\" thing...",
      "_offset": 4189,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Heehee!",
      "_offset": 4275,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Huh, a reward?",
      "_offset": 4283,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "I'll give you some fruit that I\npicked up on the way here.",
      "_offset": 4298,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Fruit, huh? Not a bad offer, Joe!",
      "_offset": 4357,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "But you *have* to help out.",
      "_offset": 4391,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Okaaaaay!",
